/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig

# The capture corpus is committed, under `captures/`, and the captures of
# emulated decks beside it, under `emu-captures/`. Recordings anywhere else in
# the tree are someone's working files, not part of either. The first rules are
# not redundant: a global ignore of `captures/` excludes the directory outright,
# and git does not look inside an excluded directory for the re-inclusions below.
!captures/
!emu-captures/
*.pcap
*.pcapng
!captures/**
!emu-captures/**
